      "paragraph": 279,
      "text": "Figure S4: 13C-NMR to confirm Ru5P/R5P isomerization. Top black trace shows labeled Ru5P and R5P generated by 13C-Ru5P isomerization by HFP. Blue trace shows chemical shifts of carbons in 13C-Ru5P. Unlabeled R5P was used to determine chemical shifts of the carbons in R5P (bottom red trace). ",
